    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7086ebfd1407dcacdae6908e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "麦昆才更了不起呢！\n直到最后一刻都死守着不让人追过，\n实力还是这么强劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e9aedfaf8f583aa9ff0ddea525fec44761ca88ddbdd32ab20ce4a5ceabae3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0896c99dfc3614565a6fa268",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆和目白赖恩。\n是那名门目白家最受期望的潜力股，\n也是艾尼斯风神的同期。",
      "source_fingerprint": "358d2b8dcbdc4ed0433b907a6e6d576ff73e39f669f2f58d557473abfcfcd1e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1325a2fe1c992f1bfd74e898",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──闪耀系列赛。\n这是让所有赛马娘感到憧憬的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74ec50f286cf8327bed060ab1b33afde5e09cddeffa6427f33340a83b9df1ab5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3806334e86c43b35e3c81cec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一想到今后的对手\n是出道前就备受瞩目的她们……\n老实说我还真希望每分每秒都能用在训练上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c79d069e699aead9acffbce0ed511692515ca626804baed3947b8b9839c222",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7937da1e5fb576031e273283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，我们赶快开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33dfcf543c7a71dac8cb7b609a7583d86dcf1afa533f2ae8340cc89a362b8dec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e4d77fdb4e63ff4a53baa8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，我们赶快开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0833986c9140857cfd4088383a8a6702071fa85cba4401c865976c916d7f5cf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
