    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5831264b87d1e431986f615d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰，训练员！\n我准时抵达！晨练麻烦啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b3ad6374395ef8497ccf7908511516175d2ac0c1f96282cc899eae785645d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba9f6e6ffeb73c74f12cdc0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的训练内容是重训和坡道两趟。\n对出道前的赛马娘来说\n负担算是比较重的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "938f76bfed4a3e8afff5887e77b81d0084d071ff23b7ab82db85f369288afef9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eadf6dd9b99f9f9b455b5cde",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但考量到她的对手是目白家那两位，\n加上她本身\n又是“转学进高中部”的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56621053b5aacdea326d7b5ec218c39eefb71935d6218a699022e97ea23a1e39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3a277354379147891ea8d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要严格执行喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2557b3e2f116e69722ec3e146d1eef807eeece6a2573e0ebc96f24828773f873",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031100.json",
