      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以现实面来说，她的肌力和直觉反应力\n都还不足以应付比赛，所以……",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c89ad8b63de3b48573aeb0836e98c0e64dfdf06df26fe48d424becde6ff0ff",
